e":"— does the review","content":"— does the review","fill":"$text-soft","fontFamily":"$font-ibm-plex-sans","fontSize":"$fontSize-16","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","x":168.91,"y":763.52},{"type":"text","id":"tjr","name":"summary accurately describe the change","content":"summary accurately describe the change","fill":"$text-soft","fontFamily":"$font-ibm-plex-sans","fontSize":"$fontSize-16","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","x":38.58,"y":789.91},{"type":"text","id":"tjs","name":"and key concerns?","content":"and key concerns?","fill":"$text-soft","fontFamily":"$font-ibm-plex-sans","fontSize":"$fontSize-16","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","x":38.58,"y":816.3},{"type":"text","id":"tjt","name":"Test corpus","content":"Test corpus","fill":"$text","fontFamily":"$font-space-grotesk","fontSize":"$fontSize-18_4","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-700","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-0_96","letterSpacing":"$letterSpacing--0_74","x":19.39,"y":871.36},{"type":"text","id":"tju","name":"The benchmark uses a set of real pull re","content":"The benchmark uses a set of real pull requests with human-annotated expected findings. Each PR has known bugs, style issues, or architectural concerns that a good reviewer should catch.","fill":"$text-soft","fontFamily":"$font-ibm-plex-sans","fontSize":"$fontSize-16","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","textGrowth":"fixed-width","width":335.72,"x":19.39,"y":898.74},{"type":"text","id":"tjv","name":"Scoring","content":"Scoring","fill":"$text","fontFamily":"$font-space-grotesk","fontSize":"$fontSize-18_4","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-700","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-0_96","letterSpacing":"$letterSpacing--0_74","x":19.39,"y":1059.36},{"type":"text","id":"tjw","name":"Each dimension is scored on a 0–5 scale.","content":"Each dimension is scored on a 0–5 scale. The overall score is a weighted average that prioritizes recall and precision over formattin