erience with no","content":"You want a zero-setup experience with no infrastructure to manage","fill":"$text-soft","fontFamily":"$font-ibm-plex-sans","fontSize":"$fontSize-16","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","x":55.38,"y":1775.55},{"type":"text","id":"t105","name":"You need GitLab, Bitbucket, or Azure Dev","content":"You need GitLab, Bitbucket, or Azure DevOps support today","fill":"$text-soft","fontFamily":"$font-ibm-plex-sans","fontSize":"$fontSize-16","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","x":55.38,"y":1801.94},{"type":"text","id":"t106","name":"You prefer a managed SaaS with a web das","content":"You prefer a managed SaaS with a web dashboard","fill":"$text-soft","fontFamily":"$font-ibm-plex-sans","fontSize":"$fontSize-16","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","x":55.38,"y":1828.33},{"type":"text","id":"t107","name":"You do not need control over which model","content":"You do not need control over which model is used","fill":"$text-soft","fontFamily":"$font-ibm-plex-sans","fontSize":"$fontSize-16","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","x":55.38,"y":1854.72},{"type":"text","id":"t108","name":"Frequently asked questions","content":"Frequently asked questions","fill":"$text","fontFamily":"$font-space-grotesk","fontSize":"$fontSize-21_6","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-700","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-0_96","letterSpacing":"$letterSpacing--0_86","textGrowth":"fixed-width","width":168.45,"x":36.19,"y":1912.44},{"type":"text","id":"t109","name":"What is the main difference between nitp","content":"What is the main difference between nitpickr and CodeRabbit?","fill":"$text","fontFamily":"$font-space-grotesk","fontSize":"$fontSize-18_4","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-700","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-0_96","letterSpacing":"$letterSpacing--0_74","x":36.19,"y":1983.21},{"type":"text","id":"t10a","name":"nitpickr is self-hosted and source-avail","content":"nitpickr is self-hosted and source-available, meaning you run it on your own infrastructure and bring your own API keys. CodeRabbit is a SaaS platform where your code is sent to their servers for review. With nitpickr, your code, logs, and model traffic never leave your infrastructure.","fill":"$text-soft","fontFamily":"$font-ibm-plex-sans","fontSize":"$fontSize-16","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","textGrowth":"fixed-width","width":628.13,"x":36.19,"y":2010.6},{"type":"text","id":"t10b","name":"Can I choose which AI model nitpickr use","content":"Can I choose which AI model nitpickr uses for code review?","fill":"$text","fontFamily":"$font-space-grotesk","fontSize":"$fontSize-18_4","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-700","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-0_96","letterSpacing":"$letterSpacing--0_74","x":36.19,"y":2144.82},{"type":"text","id":"t10c","name":"Yes. nitpickr is model-agnostic. You set","content":"Yes. nitpickr is model-agnostic. You set the model through the","fill":"$text-soft","fontFamily":"$font-ibm-plex-sans","fontSize":"$fontSize-16","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","x":36.19,"y":2172.21},{"type":"frame","id":"f10e","name":"code","x":483.25,"y":2174.69,"width":113.75,"height":22.44,"fill":"$literal-1F19130D","cornerRadius":"$rounded-5","layout":"none","children":[{"type":"text","id":"t10d","name":"OPENAI_MODEL","content":"OPENAI_MODEL","fill":"$text-soft","fontFamily":"$font-ibm-plex-mono","fontSize":"$fontSize-14_4","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","x":5.03,"y":-0.66}]},{"type":"text","id":"t10f","name":"environment variable and can use any Ope","content":"environment variable and can use any OpenAI-compatible API endpoint via","fill":"$text-soft","fontFamily":"$font-ibm-plex-sans","fontSize":"$fontSize-16","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","x":36.19,"y":2198.6},{"type":"frame","id":"f10h","name":"code","x":36.19,"y":2227.47,"width":139.67,"height":22.44,"fill":"$literal-1F19