ant review configuration to live in your repository, not a dashboard","fill":"$text-soft","fontFamily":"$font-ibm-plex-sans","fontSize":"$fontSize-16","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","textGrowth":"fixed-width","width":316.53,"x":38.58,"y":2414.14},{"type":"text","id":"t14t","name":"When to choose CodeRabbit","content":"When to choose CodeRabbit","fill":"$text","fontFamily":"$font-space-grotesk","fontSize":"$fontSize-21_6","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-700","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-0_96","letterSpacing":"$letterSpacing--0_86","textGrowth":"fixed-width","width":168.45,"x":19.39,"y":2498.26},{"type":"text","id":"t14u","name":"You want a zero-setup experience with no","content":"You want a zero-setup experience with no infrastructure to manage","fill":"$text-soft","fontFamily":"$font-ibm-plex-sans","fontSize":"$fontSize-16","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","textGrowth":"fixed-width","width":316.53,"x":38.58,"y":2553.16},{"type":"text","id":"t14v","name":"You need GitLab, Bitbucket, or Azure Dev","content":"You need GitLab, Bitbucket, or Azure DevOps support today","fill":"$text-soft","fontFamily":"$font-ibm-plex-sans","fontSize":"$fontSize-16","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","textGrowth":"fixed-width","width":316.53,"x":38.58,"y":2605.94},{"type":"text","id":"t14w","name":"You prefer a managed SaaS with a web das","content":"You prefer a managed SaaS with a web dashboard","fill":"$text-soft","fontFamily":"$font-ibm-plex-sans","fontSize":"$fontSize-16","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","textGrowth":"fixed-width","width":316.53,"x":38.58,"y":2658.72},{"type":"text","id":"t14x","name":"You do not need control over which model","content":"You do not need control over which model is used","fill":"$text-soft","fontFamily":"$font-ibm-plex-sans","fontSize":"$fontSize-16","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","textGrowth":"fixed-width","w