s their own model selectio","content":"CodeRabbit uses their own model selection. You generally cannot bring your own API keys or choose a specific model version.","fill":"$text-soft","fontFamily":"$font-ibm-plex-sans","fontSize":"$fontSize-16","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","textGrowth":"fixed-width","width":541.72,"x":19.39,"y":1279.72},{"type":"text","id":"t195","name":"Pricing","content":"Pricing","fill":"$text","fontFamily":"$font-space-grotesk","fontSize":"$fontSize-21_6","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-700","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-0_96","letterSpacing":"$letterSpacing--0_86","x":19.39,"y":1363.84},{"type":"text","id":"t196","name":"nitpickr has no subscription fee. You pa","content":"nitpickr has no subscription fee. You pay for your own LLM API usage and","fill":"$text-soft","fontFamily":"$font-ibm-plex-sans","fontSize":"$fontSize-16","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","x":19.39,"y":1398.02},{"type":"text","id":"t197","name":"whatever hosting you choose. Running loc","content":"whatever hosting you choose. Running locally with Docker Compose and a","fill":"$text-soft","fontFamily":"$font-ibm-plex-sans","fontSize":"$fontSize-16","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","x":19.39,"y":1424.41},{"type":"text","id":"t198","name":"free HTTPS tunnel (like","content":"free HTTPS tunnel (like","fill":"$text-soft","fontFamily":"$font-ibm-plex-sans","fontSize":"$fontSize-16","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","x":19.39,"y":1450.8},{"type":"frame","id":"f19a","name":"code","x":188.69,"y":1453.28,"width":105.11,"height":22.44,"fill":"$literal-1F19130D","cornerRadius":"$rounded-5","layout":"none","children":[{"type":"text","id":"t199","name":"cloudflared","content":"cloudflared","fill":"$text-soft","fontFamily":"$font-ibm-plex-mono","fontSize":"$fontSize-14_4","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","x":5.03,"y":-0.66}]},{"type":"text","id":"t19b","name":") means you mainly pay for OpenAI","content":") means you mainly pay for OpenAI","fill":"$text-soft","fontFamily":"$font-ibm-plex-sans","fontSize":"$fontSize-16","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","x":293.8,"y":1450.8},{"type":"text","id":"t19c","name":"API calls.","content":"API calls.","fill":"$text-soft","fontFamily":"$font-ibm-plex-sans","fontSize":"$fontSize-16","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","x":19.39,"y":1477.19},{"type":"text","id":"t19d","name":"CodeRabbit uses per-seat pricing with mo","content":"CodeRabbit uses per-seat pricing with monthly or annual subscriptions. The free tier has usage limits.","fill":"$text-soft","fontFamily":"$font-ibm-plex-sans","fontSize":"$fontSize-16","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","textGrowth":"fixed-width","width":541.72,"x":19.39,"y":1522.77},{"type":"text","id":"t19e","name":"When to choose nitpickr","content":"When to choose nitpickr","fill":"$text","fontFamily":"$font-space-grotesk","fontSize":"$fontSize-21_6","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-700","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-0_96","letterSpacing":"$letterSpacing--0_86","textGrowth":"fixed-width","width":168.45,"x":19.39,"y":1606.88},{"type":"text","id":"t19f","name":"You want your code to stay on your own i","content":"You want your code to stay on your own infrastructure","fill":"$text-soft","fontFamily":"$font-ibm-plex-sans","fontSize":"$fontSize-16","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","x":38.58,"y":1661.78},{"type":"text","id":"t19g","name":"You want to choose and switch AI models ","content":"You want to choose and switch AI models freely","fill":"$text-soft","fontFamily":"$font-ibm-plex-sans","fontSize":"$fontSize-16","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","x":38.58,"y":1688.18},{"type":"text","id":"t19h","name":"You prefer paying only for actual API us","content":"You prefer paying only for actual API usage instead of per-seat fees","fill":"$text-soft","fontFamily":"$font-ibm-plex-sans","fontSize":"$fontSize-16","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","x":38.58,"y":1714.57},{"type":"text","id":"t19i","name":"You value source-available software you ","content":"You value source-available software you can inspect and modify","fill":"$text-soft","fontFamily":"$font-ibm-plex-sans","fontSize":"$fontSize-16","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","x":38.58,"y":1740.96},{"type":"text","id":"t19j","name":"You want review configuration to live in","content":"You want review configuration to live in your repository, not a dashboard","fill":"$text-soft","fontFamily":"$font-ibm-plex-sans","fontSize":"$fontSize-16","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","x":38.58,"y":1767.35},{"type":"text","id":"t19k","name":"When to choose CodeRabbit","content":"When to choose CodeRabbit","fill":"$text","fontFamily":"$font-space-grotesk","fontSize":"$fontSize-21_6","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-700","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-0_96","letterSpacing":"$letterSpacing--0_86","textGrowth":"fixed-width","width":168.45,"x":19.39,"y":1825.07},{"type":"text","id":"t19l","name":"You want a zero-setup experience with no","content":"You want a zero-setup experience with no infrastructure to manage","fill":"$text-soft","fontFamily":"$font-ibm-plex-sans","fontSize":"$fontSize-16","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","x":38.58,"y":1879.97},{"type":"text","id":"t19m","name":"You need GitLab, Bitbucket, or Azure Dev","content":"You need GitLab, Bitbucket, or Azure DevOps support today","fill":"$text-soft","fontFamily":"$font-ibm-plex-sans","fontSize":"$fontSize-16","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","x":38.58,"y":1906.36},{"type":"text","id":"t19n","name":"You prefer a managed SaaS with a web das","content":"You prefer a managed SaaS with a web dashboard","fill":"$text-soft","fontFamily":"$font-ibm-plex-sans","fon